questions.question:
Perhatikan potongan kode berikut di dalam loop():

digitalWrite(13, HIGH);
delay(500);
digitalWrite(13, LOW);
delay(500);

Berapa kali LED pada pin 13 menyala (satu siklus kedip lengkap) dalam waktu 10 detik?

questions.question_en:
Look at the following code snippet inside loop():

digitalWrite(13, HIGH);
delay(500);
digitalWrite(13, LOW);
delay(500);

How many times does the LED on pin 13 turn on (one complete blink cycle) in 10 seconds?

questions.question:
Sebuah kipas disambung ke COM dan NO pada relay yang aktif saat pin diberi HIGH. Program di loop():

digitalWrite(relay, HIGH);
delay(5000);
digitalWrite(relay, LOW);
delay(1000);

Dalam 60 detik, berapa total waktu kipas menyala?

questions.question_en:
A fan is connected to COM and NO on a relay that activates when the pin is set HIGH. The program in loop():

digitalWrite(relay, HIGH);
delay(5000);
digitalWrite(relay, LOW);
delay(1000);

In 60 seconds, what is the total time the fan is on?

questions.question:
